"%(counter)s system."
msgid_plural ""
"On %(on)s the share moved from %(before)s percent to %(after)s percent, "
"across %(counter)s systems."
msgstr[0] ""
"Am %(on)s wechselte der Anteil von %(before)s Prozent auf %(after)s Prozent, "
"in %(counter)s System."
msgstr[1] ""
"Am %(on)s wechselte der Anteil von %(before)s Prozent auf %(after)s Prozent, "
